  "rationale": "The 29a8 root had no zsh and no static glibc, so sysfs_rtc_determinism, which reads the RTC through zsh among other shells, and kvm_info_log_determinism, whose kvm_memory_hashes_repeat_for_a_static_guest compiles a static guest, could not run in test.hermit_integration (https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/issues/4355). This replacement adds nixpkgs' zsh to guestTools and glibc.static to the image, with its lib directory on LIBRARY_PATH after the compiler wrapper's own glibc. Two new independent physical stores reproduced archive 9d5d40 byte-for-byte and loaded as dd70."
 },
